<p>Imbues your body with arcane forces, reconstructing it to a default state, healing for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">366, 479, 567, 641, 707</acronym> life.</p><p>The life healed will increase with your Spellpower.</p>